# @ryph/auth — environment for the STANDALONE composition root (`bun run dev`). The
# default local deployment doesn't run this process: @ryph/host mounts this package's
# setup() in-process, over the shared database.
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and adjust.

# ── Listener ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#RYPH_AUTH_PORT=7412

# ── Database ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A ryph database URL: pglite:<path> (embedded PostgreSQL on disk), pglite:memory://
# (throwaway) or postgres://… . Mounted in the control plane, auth shares ITS database, so this
# is normally the same value the orchestrator gets. Provision the schema first:
# `bun run db:push` in this package.
#RYPH_DB=pglite:./data/ryph
